# PumpCycle Function Block (ST)

## Purpose
Controls discharge pump stage:
- Runs pump until tank is empty.
- Signals completion when discharge finished.

## Inputs
- `Cycle_Active : BOOL` — overall cycle running.
- `Stage_Ready : BOOL` — discharge stage condition met.
- `Tn_Level_Low : BOOL` — tank empty sensor.

## Outputs
- `Pump_Discharge : BOOL` — pump ON/OFF.
- `Discharge_Complete : BOOL` — flag when discharge done.

## Logic (ST)
```pascal
FUNCTION_BLOCK PumpController_FB_ST
VAR_INPUT
    Cycle_Active   : BOOL;
    Stage_Ready    : BOOL;
    Tn_Level_Low   : BOOL;
END_VAR

VAR_OUTPUT
    Pump_Discharge     : BOOL := FALSE;
    Discharge_Complete : BOOL := FALSE;
END_VAR

IF Cycle_Active AND Stage_Ready THEN
    Pump_Discharge := NOT Tn_Level_Low;
    IF Tn_Level_Low THEN
        Discharge_Complete := TRUE;
        Pump_Discharge := FALSE;
    END_IF;
ELSE
    Pump_Discharge := FALSE;
    Discharge_Complete := FALSE;
END_IF;
